   ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   
   │ Move                                Conversations                      │   
   │ j/k       down / up                 r/R       reply all / reply        │   
   │ J/K       page; sidebar: account    f         forward                  │   
   │ ^d/^u     half page down / up       A/D       open / save attachments  │   
   │ gg/G      top / bottom              U         open a link              │   
   │ h/l       pane left / right         a         archive                  │   
   │ enter/esc open / back               dd        move to Trash            │   
   │ n/p       next / prev (reader)      I/!       to Inbox / spam          │   
   │ tab/⇧tab  next / prev message       N         mark read / unread       │   
   │                                     *         star / unstar            │   
   │ Everywhere                          x/T       select / read together   │   
   │ c         write a new mail          u         undo (again: earlier)    │   
   │ /         search all mail           o         expand / collapse all    │   
   │ s         sync now                  O         open here in Gmail (web) │   
   │ [/]       previous / next account                                      │   
   │ b         show / hide mailboxes     Go to                              │   
   │ C         account color (sidebar)   gi/gs     Inbox / Starred          │   
   │ L         what Gmail rejected       gt/gd     Sent / Drafts            │   
   │ ?         this help                 ga/g#     All Mail / Trash         │   
   │ ZZ        quit (q: in the list)     g!        Spam                     │   
   │                                                                        │   
   │ Press any key to close.                                                │   
   ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯   